    {
      "id": "9f10e107-0eed-45f8-8527-c20ce6bdac91",
      "question": "What is the mechanism of As(V) (arsenate) toxicity?",
      "answer": "Arsenate substitutes for inorganic phosphate in glycolytic and oxidative phosphorylation reactions → uncouples ATP synthesis (arsenolysis).",
