    {
      "id": "036acf0d-39dc-4a12-8238-310cdd0a8a59",
      "question": "What distinguishes an adaptive response from an adverse effect in study interpretation?",
      "answer": "Adaptive: homeostatic response without functional/structural impairment (CYP induction, hypertrophy without injury). Adverse: change impairing normal health, growth, or development",
