    {
      "id": "5aec0a98-eba1-4d3a-b1b7-fa878c104b51",
      "question": "In NOAEL determination, what three factors beyond p-values must you consider?",
      "answer": "Totality of evidence (dose-response trend, histopath, direction of changes), biological vs statistical significance, study power (underpowered not-significant likely Type II error)",
