    },
    {
      "id": "cf70b382-edc8-4297-a126-a88ad7313746",
      "question": "Name the 4 uncertainty factors used in RfD derivation, and what each accounts for.",
      "answer": "1. Interspecies (animal to human) — default 10× 2. Intraspecies (human variability) — default 10× 3. Subchronic → Chronic — default 10× 4. LOAEL → NOAEL — default 10× (used when NOAEL not available)",
